## The Stowaway

::bg{location="module-nine-void" time="ship-night"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: A hatch that should have been welded shut in the yard, with the paint worn off its lip from opening.

::auto{character="ottavio" anchor="starboard" action="unseal"}
@ottavio{code="0020" emotion="clipped"}: Don't. Whatever you were about to do with your hands — don't.
@ottavio{code="0030" emotion="frayed"}: You're not the Purser. The Purser doesn't knock.

::assert{found(ottavio)}
::assert{awake(ottavio)}
@ottavio{code="0040" emotion="level"}: Ottavio. I load ships. I have loaded this one four times and never once been aboard it.

::assert{knows(ottavio, manifest)}
@ottavio{code="0050" emotion="wry"}: I'm not on the manifest. That isn't an accident, that's a career.
@ottavio{code="0060" emotion="level"}: The Purser allocates against listed mass. I'm not listed. I eat, I breathe, I don't count.
@ottavio{code="0070" emotion="stricken" when="run.shedPressure >= 2"}: Only the schedule's running at twice the rate I planned for, and I've been doing arithmetic I don't enjoy.
@ottavio{code="0080" emotion="hollowed"}: When it takes this module it won't subtract me from the total. It'll just take me.

@ilsabet{code="0090" emotion="clipped" os when="holds(awake(ilsabet))"}: He's lying about one thing. Ask him who altered the heading.
@ottavio{code="0100" emotion="frayed" when="holds(awake(ilsabet))"}: One thing. She says that as though it were a small number.

@ottavio{code="0110" emotion="level"}: So. You're the first person aboard who knows I'm here. Do something useful with that.
